// Public Suffix List snapshot (publicsuffix.org format, MPL-2.0 data).
//
// This file is DATA, not code. It is parsed by app/domain/publicsuffix.py using
// the real PSL matching algorithm: exact rules, "*" wildcard rules, "!"
// exception rules, ICANN/PRIVATE sections.
//
// It is a curated snapshot covering every multi-label suffix that matters for
// the markets this product touches (KG + CIS + the ccTLDs our sources return).
// Operators who need the complete upstream list drop it in and point
// PUBLIC_SUFFIX_LIST_PATH at it - no code change required. Unlisted suffixes
// fall back to the PSL default rule ("*") plus an explicit second-level-under-
// ccTLD guard, so an unknown suffix degrades safely instead of collapsing
// unrelated companies onto one dedupe key.
//
// ===BEGIN ICANN DOMAINS===

